{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。X 的大字把主旨和解释放在同一层，扫读时不如 Y 一眼抓住主线，尤其部分长句需要更多注意力才能读完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的大字更像清晰的段落提要，扫得快，也容易抓住每段发生了什么；但它把不少心理动机、犹豫和转折放进了小字，普通观众容易只看到结果而漏掉原因。X 把关键心理变化留在确定能看到的大字里，尤其 S05 的失措、S06 的孤单，以及 S13 想把喜欢藏回去却发现自己更难受的内在拉扯，保留得更完整。整体上，X 不只是讲清楚他做了什么，也更清楚地让人感受到他为什么一步步走到最后的选择，因此叙事连贯性和情感细腻度更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0dd9e294-deab-4c92-977a-4ebd208bb195", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T193824585916Z", "elapsed_seconds": 93.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:39:57.872709+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ff93260d1324dfdaf87a169ab4dde3031f2f9851c9875d1ea4169a1233da6d68", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 